     "w": 1280,
     "h": 1383
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "The reason why we advertise on pages is to generate data for one of our product Sheet Director.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/57a7aa5d52a85c1d.png",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1280,
     "h": 805
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Sheet Director supports more than 50+ apps. One among those apps is Google AdSense. In order to generate data for Google AdSense for testing our product Sheet Director AdSense interface we are advertising in our website.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/1ab5955f2dd574d1.png",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1280,
     "h": 343
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "We are placing the advertisement only on the footer of the website so that it does not interfere user's flow of reading in our website.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
